{"id":"83380dd5-6be2-4541-8f12-a49f84fc3bb4","object":"chat.completion","created":1795243487,"model":"deepseek-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"SELECT p.payment_type, ROUND(AVG(r.review_score), 2) AS avg_score\nFROM order_reviews r\nJOIN (SELECT DISTINCT order_id, payment_type FROM order_payments) p\n  ON p.order_id = r.order_id\nGROUP BY p.payment_type\nORDER BY p.payment_type\nLIMIT 100;","reasoning_content":"我们需要回答SQL。需要根据问题。需要每条评价在其订单使用的每种支付方式下各计一次，同单同方式多次支付不重复加权评价。需要每种支付方式的评价平均分，两位。\n\n表：order_payments(order_id,payment_sequential,payment_type,payment_value...), order_reviews(review_id,order_id,review_score). 需要将每条评价与订单使用的支付方式去重 (order_id, payment_type) 关联。然后按 payment_type 分组 avg(review_score) 两位。计数加权：每条评价对每个订单使用的每种支付方式各计一次；同单同方式多次支付不重复。因为一条订单可能多条评价？order_reviews主键(review_id, order_id)，可能同订单多评价。每条评价 join distinct payment types for its order. 查询:\n\nSELECT p.payment_type, ROUND(AVG(r.review_score),2) AS avg_score\nFROM order_reviews r\nJOIN (SELECT DISTINCT order_id, payment_type FROM order_payments) p ON p.order_id = r.order_id\nGROUP BY p.payment_type\nORDER BY p.payment_type\nLIMIT ? 默认TopN至多N行? 问题没要求排序，按每种支付方式，应列出所有支付方式。硬性必须LIMIT除非单行聚合。需要LIMIT。可 LIMIT 100。排序？\"每种\" 不指定排序，可以按payment_type或平均分？ 默认多列少列，不额外排序? 需要LIMIT，排序稳定。可以 ORDER BY p.payment_type LIMIT 100. 注意 payment_type可能NULL? 去重保留NULL，分组一行NULL? 平均分。无需过滤。ROUND AVG numeric? review_score integer, AVG(integer) returns numeric? In PostgreSQL avg(integer) returns numeric, yes ROUND numeric. Good.\n\n需要只输出SQL，无代码围栏。可加注释首行？复杂多表可加，但不必要。输出直接。"},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":2900,"completion_tokens":501,"total_tokens":3401,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":2688},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":425},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":2688,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":212},"system_fingerprint":"bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}